# Java Snippets

A quick cheat sheet for common Java collection and graph patterns.

---

## 1) Initialize an ArrayList quickly

```java
List<Integer> arrayList = new ArrayList<>();
arrayList.add(5);
arrayList.add(4);
arrayList.add(15);
```

Instead of adding one by one, use `Arrays.asList()`:

```java
List<Integer> numbers = Arrays.asList(5, 4, 15);
```

Note: `Arrays.asList()` returns a fixed-size list.

