## 2) Sort an array of int

```java
int[] array = {2, 9, 6, 8, 1, 10};

Arrays.sort(array);          // Sort the full array
Arrays.sort(array, 1, 4);    // Sort from index 1 (inclusive) to 4 (exclusive)
```

