## 5) HashMap counter pattern

```java
HashMap<Integer, Integer> map = new HashMap<>();

for (Integer node : edgeNodesList) {
    map.put(node, map.getOrDefault(node, 0) + 1);
}
```

This keeps a count for each key in the map.

